.kotlin/
.DS_Store

# The Kotlin/JS lock file is committed on purpose. The engine's Date reads its zone rules through
# an npm package on that target, and which version resolves decides whether named zones work at
# all, so the lock is part of the build being reproducible.
!kotlin-js-store/

# Reference source tree, for porting and study only. It is the full Rhino clone
# (about 40 MB) pinned at the release the port mirrors. It never gets committed;
# reference/REFERENCES.md records the pin and the file mapping.
reference/
